5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to know the monthly cost and who pays upfront.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I need to know the actual hours involved. If we outsource, does that truly remove the time burden from my schedule?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I need to see where the usage and the labor actually sit. Who is doing the work versus who is using the space?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I just want to stop guessing what state the rooms will be in. Predictability is my main concern here.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I care most about keeping us on speaking terms. I want an arrangement that prevents resentment from building up over the year.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if we hire help, the hours vanish, but the cost stays. I need to track that.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
